---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy, Terms & Cancellation Policy | Event Point Ranchi"
  description="How Event Point Ranchi handles enquiry information, quotation terms and cancellation requests."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Policies</span>
      <h1>Clear terms for a calm planning process.</h1>
      <p>These policies cover website enquiries and quotations. Confirmed bookings are also governed by the written quotation and agreement issued by Event Point Ranchi.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow policy-content">
      <article id="privacy">
        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          We collect the details you submit through the event requirements form — your name, phone
          number, optional email address, event information, venue, guest count and requirements —
          only to review and respond to your enquiry.
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> We do not sell or rent enquiry information.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Details are shared internally with the planning team handling your event.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> You can ask us to correct or delete your enquiry details by writing to info@eventpointranchi.com.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Draft requirements are stored in your own browser and are cleared when you clear your browser storage or submit the enquiry.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article id="terms">
        <h2>Quotation terms</h2>
        <p>
          Submitting the event requirements form is an enquiry, not a booking. A quotation is
          prepared after our team reviews your date, venue, dimensions and stock availability. Prices,
          inclusions and validity periods are stated in the written quotation.
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Dates and equipment are not held until a written confirmation and any required advance are received.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Custom dimensions are subject to venue access, ceiling height and site feasibility.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Photographs represent design concepts; seasonal flowers and finishes may vary slightly.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Final delivery, setup and removal timings are agreed in writing before the event.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article id="cancellations">
        <h2>Cancellations</h2>
        <p>
          Cancellation terms depend on the confirmed quotation, the notice period and costs already
          committed on your behalf. Please contact us in writing as early as possible if your plans
          change.
        </p>
        <ul class="spec-list">
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Enquiries can be withdrawn at any time before a quotation is confirmed.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Confirmed bookings follow the cancellation schedule stated in the signed quotation.</li>
          <li><Icon name="check-circle" size={15} /> Any refundable amount and processing timeline are confirmed in writing.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Questions? Email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@eventpointranchi.com">info@eventpointranchi.com</a>
          or call <a class="text-link" href="tel:+919876543210">+91 98765 43210</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
